        "Exception flow claim 2 starts at Main Flow Step 2 with the Force Tell/Emergency Indicators condition, but after stating that the message overrides all operator-controllable data filters it does not define the branch outcome. It neither returns to a Main Flow step, terminates/hands off, nor ends in an explicit terminal failure/prevention state, leaving the exception flow without a clear exit.",
